    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 17 and 18"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.16.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch17ch18-lineage/1.16.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch17ch18_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.16.0 (2026-11-12): Chapter 18 story 5 replaced and chapter 18 rebuilt from draft v1_0_2."@en .

ex:ST7_ReplaceCh18Story5 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Draft DRAFT_ch18_v1_0_2.md applied on the owner decision of 2026-11-12 (the rule is to replace a repeated story). Story 5 is now the ElementTree origin story (created 20 October 2001, added to the Python project 12 December 2005), from the module's own history header, Python commit mails and a core developer's article; it no longer shares its source page with chapter 16. Picture: no free portrait of Fredrik Lundh exists on Wikimedia Commons, so the picture is the module's history header drawn as text, said on the slide and in the notes; this is not a photograph and departs from the real-picture preference, to be ruled on by the owner if a photograph is wanted. The owner approved replacing; the exact wording of the draft was not separately confirmed." .

ex:ST7_RenderCh18 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Rebuilt 2026-11-12: deck SEN0414_Ch18_CSVJSONXML_3e_v2_0_3.pptx (53 slides; v2_0_2 stays), manifest chapter_code_ch18_v1_0_3.json, stories sen0414_ch18_stories_v1_2_0.py, page sen0414_ch18_page_v9_96_2.html (only stories, chapter-code list and version differ from v9_96_1). Checks: manifest self-check PASS (27 examples); deck standard check v1.0.0 PASS; overlap CLEAN; 20 links answer 200; stories self-check 0 failures; logs in 08-tooling/ch18-deck/logs_v2_0_3. Not clean: page test 9.37.0 stopped at 70 passed, 0 failed when the browser tab crashed, the same as the accepted pages on this machine; the rest is not verified here. Build files made by ch18-deck/story5_replace_make_v2_0_3.py." .
